Today is Saturday.
The morning weather in Kochi is nice.
I come outside the apartment.
Anitha is there.
"Good morning, Maya," Anitha says.
"Are you going out?" she asks.
I say, "Yes, I am going to the city."
Anitha smiles.
"Go to Marine Drive," she says.
"It is a good place."
"How do I go there?"
I ask.
Anitha tells me the way.
"First, walk straight from here."
"Then, turn right."
"There is a bus stop there."
"Go by bus to the city from there."
"Okay, thank you very much," I say.
